{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37848","headline":"中秋夜有怀 · 许彬","name":"中秋夜有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"趋驰早晚休，一岁又残秋。\n若只如今日，何难致白头。\n沧波归处远，旅舍向边愁。\n赖见前贤说，穷通不自由。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许彬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37848.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37848","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}